{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/extras/52dc9643694b70ff7d09c3ea4632f03e.poster.avif?t=1768900674\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/extras/52dc9643694b70ff7d09c3ea4632f03e.webm?t=1768900674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/extras/52dc9643694b70ff7d09c3ea4632f03e.mp4?t=1768900674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of the \u201cColossi\u201d \u2014 ancient beings capable of guiding them in their search for the Seven Keys of Eden \u2014 the Envoys of the Spirits begin their journey through the living forests of Panfa. But their quest is soon disrupted when the creatures of the land are consumed by a dark energy, plunging the world into chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joined by Mhalka, a scholar from an ancient tribe, the group ventures deep into the heart of Panfa, facing countless trials to uncover the source of this corruption \u2014 and the forgotten truths buried by time itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/extras/a4067f79f6f14a3f4049015e98268052.avif?t=1768900674\" width=600 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Akasha: Taliokata's Tomb&quot; is a hand-drawn, side-scrolling action platformer focused on combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play as Hug, Lya, Eld, or Atte and create unique combos by combining normal attacks with elemental magic. Each character has their own combat style and special abilities that can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Controller is required for local multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the map, you\u2019ll find mysterious golden leaves\u2026<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/extras/60f62b64d2f76654e85c7a002c41ab63.webp?t=1768900674\" width=53 height=56 /></span> Something good might happen if you collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/extras/90f6ca6de1136cb5af9cf1f8b5c33041.avif?t=1768900674\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art in the original manga\u2019s style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling and immersive soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable secret content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich story told throughout each stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat with diverse combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully crafted environments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-</strong>MESSAGE FROM THE AUTHOR<strong>-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is with great joy that I present this title.<br><strong>\u201cAkasha: Taliokata\u2019s Tomb\u201d</strong> was entirely drawn and programmed by myself,<br>featuring an incredible soundtrack and sound effects produced by my best friend, Atte. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I truly hope that this story and its characters will create fond memories for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for reading, and see you in the next volume of <i>Akasha</i>!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4109390?t=1768900674","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/b09192f57d5b668222bb307c7d0001f31666acf7/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1768900674","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/b1032b4a87fb2421adae33910ff67e53046b7c1c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1768900674","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/b1032b4a87fb2421adae33910ff67e53046b7c1c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1768900674","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/extras/52dc9643694b70ff7d09c3ea4632f03e.poster.avif?t=1768900674\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/extras/52dc9643694b70ff7d09c3ea4632f03e.webm?t=1768900674\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/extras/52dc9643694b70ff7d09c3ea4632f03e.mp4?t=1768900674\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In search of the \u201cColossi\u201d \u2014 ancient beings capable of guiding them in their search for the Seven Keys of Eden \u2014 the Envoys of the Spirits begin their journey through the living forests of Panfa. But their quest is soon disrupted when the creatures of the land are consumed by a dark energy, plunging the world into chaos. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Joined by Mhalka, a scholar from an ancient tribe, the group ventures deep into the heart of Panfa, facing countless trials to uncover the source of this corruption \u2014 and the forgotten truths buried by time itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/extras/a4067f79f6f14a3f4049015e98268052.avif?t=1768900674\" width=600 height=130 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Akasha: Taliokata's Tomb&quot; is a hand-drawn, side-scrolling action platformer focused on combat.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play as Hug, Lya, Eld, or Atte and create unique combos by combining normal attacks with elemental magic. Each character has their own combat style and special abilities that can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >*Controller is required for local multiplayer.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you explore the map, you\u2019ll find mysterious golden leaves\u2026<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/extras/60f62b64d2f76654e85c7a002c41ab63.webp?t=1768900674\" width=53 height=56 /></span> Something good might happen if you collect them all!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/extras/90f6ca6de1136cb5af9cf1f8b5c33041.avif?t=1768900674\" width=600 height=100 /></span></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hand-drawn art in the original manga\u2019s style</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A thrilling and immersive soundtrack</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlockable secret content</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A rich story told throughout each stage</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast-paced combat with diverse combos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Intense boss battles</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beautifully crafted environments</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>-</strong>MESSAGE FROM THE AUTHOR<strong>-</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is with great joy that I present this title.<br><strong>\u201cAkasha: Taliokata\u2019s Tomb\u201d</strong> was entirely drawn and programmed by myself,<br>featuring an incredible soundtrack and sound effects produced by my best friend, Atte. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >I truly hope that this story and its characters will create fond memories for everyone.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Thank you for reading, and see you in the next volume of <i>Akasha</i>!</p>","developers":["ugokouhei"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4109390/e6c9e46d2696cde31d0fe03acb1b0e44d07104af/header.jpg?t=1768900674","is_free":false,"legal_notice":"\u00a9 2025 Ugo Kouhei. All Rights Reserved.","linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109390/232717525/fd01b4b64edc74d2b47345a0fd0d4285c25a098f/1760539555/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761560070","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109390/232717525/fd01b4b64edc74d2b47345a0fd0d4285c25a098f/1760539555/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761560070","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4109390/232717525/fd01b4b64edc74d2b47345a0fd0d4285c25a098f/1760539555/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761560070","id":257218341,"name":"Akasha: Taliokata's Tomb - Official Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamst